 <div class="workspace-bar"><div><span class="breadcrumb">Workspace /</span> Trading terminal <span class="version">BETA 0.1</span></div><div class="status-line"><span class="status-dot"></span> Workspace ready <span class="bar-divider">|</span><Clock3 size={12}/> <span>{updated} local</span><button onclick={()=>modal='Workspace guide'} class="text-icon"><CircleHelp size={15}/></button></div></div>
 <section class="overview"><div class="overview-title"><span class="eyebrow">THE BIG PICTURE</span><h1>A clearer view. A smarter hive<span>.</span></h1><p>One workspace. Independent perspectives. Risk comes first.</p></div><div class="account-stat"><span>PAPER BOOK VALUE <Wallet size={13}/></span><strong>${money(account?.equity??10000)}</strong><small><span class="neutral-dot"></span> Simulated capital</small></div><div class="account-stat"><span>AVAILABLE CASH</span><strong>${money(account?.cash??10000)}</strong><small>Isolated paper account</small></div><div class="account-stat compact"><span>BASELINE BEES</span><strong>{bees.filter(b=>b.status==='paper').length}<em> / {bees.length}</em></strong><small>Baselines + research</small></div><button class="outline-button pause-button" onclick={toggle} disabled={!account}>{#if account?.paused}<Play size={14}/> Resume paper{:else}<Pause size={14}/> Pause paper{/if}</button></section>
 <main class="trading-grid">
 <section id="market-watch" class="watchlist panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Market watch</h2><button class="icon-button" title="Watchlist information" onclick={()=>modal='Market watch'}><Plus size={16}/></button></div><div class="search-box"><Search size={14}/><input placeholder="Search markets" bind:value={query} aria-label="Search markets"/><kbd>/</kbd></div><div class="market-filters">{#each ['All markets','Crypto','Forex'] as filter}<button class:chosen={marketFilter===filter} onclick={()=>marketFilter=filter}>{filter}</button>{/each}</div><div class="watch-label"><span>ASSET / VOLUME</span><span>PRICE / 24H</span></div><div class="market-list">{#each visibleMarkets as m}<button class="market-row" class:selected={selected===m.symbol} onclick={()=>selectMarket(m.symbol)}><span class="coin-icon" style={`--coin:${m.color||'#d8ad54'}`}>{m.icon||m.symbol.slice(0,1)}</span><span class="market-name"><strong>{m.symbol.replace('-',' / ')}</strong><small>{m.name}</small></span><span class="market-price"><strong>{money(m.price,m.kind==='forex'?4:2)}</strong><small class:positive={(m.change??0)>0} class:negative={(m.change??0)<0}>{m.change===null?'Awaiting quote':`${m.change>=0?'+':''}${money(m.change)}%`}</small></span></button>{/each}{#if !visibleMarkets.length}<p class="empty-small">{marketFilter === 'Forex' ? 'Forex feed not connected · research planned' : 'No matching markets.'}</p>{/if}</div><div class="watch-footer"><ShieldCheck size={15}/><span>Public market data<br/><small>Execution requires a fresh quote</small></span></div></section>
 <section class="chart-panel panel"><div class="instrument-header"><div class="instrument-name"><span class="coin-icon large" style={`--coin:${market.color||'#e6b654'}`}>{market.icon||'₿'}</span><div><h2>{selected.replace('-',' / ')} <ChevronDown size={15}/></h2><span>{market.name} <span class="spot-label">{market.kind==='forex'?'FOREX':'SPOT'}</span></span></div><button class="icon-button" title="Market details" onclick={()=>modal='Market details'}><CircleHelp size={14}/></button></div><div class="instrument-value"><strong>${money(market.price??close?.close,market.kind==='forex'?4:2)}</strong><span class:negative={(market.change??0)<0} class="positive">{market.change===null?'Quote pending':`${market.change>=0?'+':''}${money(market.change)}%`}</span></div><div class="instrument-meta"><span>24H VOLUME<strong>{market.volume||'—'}</strong></span><span>DATA SOURCE<strong>{live?'Public feed':'Preview'}</strong></span></div></div><div class="chart-toolbar"><div class="timeframes">{#each ['1m','5m','15m','1H','4H','1D'] as tf}<button class:chosen={timeframe===tf} onclick={()=>{timeframe=tf;chart();}}>{tf}</button>{/each}</div><span class="toolbar-rule"></span><button class="text-icon" onclick={()=>modal='Chart indicators'}><SlidersHorizontal size={14}/> Indicators</button><div class="chart-toolbar-right"><span class:feed-live={live} class="feed-badge"><span></span>{live?'PUBLIC FEED':'PREVIEW DATASET'}</span><button class="icon-button" title="Refresh chart" onclick={chart}><RefreshCw size={14}/></button></div></div><div class="chart-container"><div class="chart-legend"><span>{selected.replace('-',' / ')} · {timeframe}</span><small>O <b>{money(close?.open)}</b> H <b>{money(close?.high)}</b> L <b>{money(close?.low)}</b> C <b>{money(close?.close)}</b></small></div><MarketChart {candles}/>{#if loading}<div class="loading-label">Updating market data…</div>{/if}<div class="chart-watermark">Omie<span>Bot</span></div></div><div class="chart-footer"><span><Radio size={12}/>{source}</span><span>Price in USD · {candles.length} candles</span></div></section>
 <aside class="ticket-column"><section class="ticket panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Paper trade</h2><span class="tiny-badge">SIMULATED</span></div><div class="buy-sell"><button class:buy-selected={side==='buy'} onclick={()=>side='buy'}>Buy / Long</button><button class:sell-selected={side==='sell'} onclick={()=>side='sell'}>Sell / Reduce</button></div><div class="ticket-label"><span>Order type</span><span>Market <ChevronDown size={12}/></span></div><label class="amount-label" for="amount">Amount <span>USD</span></label><div class="amount-input"><span>$</span><input id="amount" type="number" min="1" bind:value={amount}/><span>USD</span></div><div class="amount-presets">{#each [50,100,250,500] as n}<button onclick={()=>amount=String(n)}>${n}</button>{/each}</div><label class="amount-label" for="bee">Assign to bee <span>Optional</span></label><select id="bee" bind:value={selectedBee}><option value="">Manual paper trade</option>{#each bees.filter(b=>b.status==='paper') as b}<option value={b.id}>{b.name}</option>{/each}</select><div class="order-summary"><div><span>Available cash</span><strong>${money(account?.cash??10000)}</strong></div><div><span>Execution</span><strong>Fresh public quote</strong></div><div><span>Estimated quantity</span><strong>{market.price?money(Number(amount)/market.price,6):'Quote required'}</strong></div></div><button class="submit-order" class:sell-order={side==='sell'} onclick={order} disabled={busy||!account||account.paused}>{busy?'Validating quote…':`${side==='buy'?'Buy':'Sell'} ${selected.split('-')[0]}`}<ArrowRight size={16}/></button><p class="ticket-note"><ShieldCheck size={12}/> Paper only. No exchange account connected.</p></section><section class="risk-panel panel"><div class="risk-heading"><span class="shield-icon"><ShieldCheck size={18}/></span><div><h3>Guardrails, always on.</h3><small>Code has the final say.</small></div><span class="status-dot"></span></div><div class="risk-row"><span>Mode</span><strong>Paper trading</strong></div><div class="risk-row"><span>Leverage</span><strong>1× · spot only</strong></div><div class="risk-row"><span>Live execution</span><strong class="muted">Disabled</strong></div><button onclick={()=>modal='Risk policy'}>View risk policy <ArrowUpRight size={12}/></button></section></aside>
