l backtest → fees and slippage stress → independent review → forward paper trading → approval. A rule rewrite creates a versioned challenger; it does not prove improvement.</p>{:else}<p>Welcome to your OmieBot AI Trading research workspace. Explore live public market data, compare specialist Bees, and record paper trades with an auditable ledger. Preview datasets are always labeled. Performance is never invented.</p>{/if}<button class="submit-order" onclick={()=>modal=''}>Back to workspace <ArrowRight size={16}/></button></div></div>{/if}
